       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TABLE-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TBL.
          05 ITEM PIC 99 OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 I PIC 9.
       01 TOT PIC 999 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
               COMPUTE ITEM(I) = I * I
               ADD ITEM(I) TO TOT
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY TOT
           STOP RUN.
